<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>AI Visibility Audit — {{ business_name }}</title>
<style>
  @page { size: Letter; margin: 0; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Inter", "Segoe UI", Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #0f172a; background: #fafafa; }
  .page { width: 8.5in; padding: 0.55in 0.75in 0.75in; position: relative; background: #fafafa; }
  .page-cover, .page-cta { min-height: 11in; page-break-after: always; }
  .page-break { page-break-before: always; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { margin: 0; font-weight: 600; }
  h2 { font-size: 20pt; line-height: 1.2; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4pt; }
  h3 { font-size: 13pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.3; }
  h4 { font-size: 9pt; margin: 0 0 6pt; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; font-weight: 600; }
  p { margin: 0 0 10pt; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 10.5pt; color: #334155; }
  .muted { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 10.5pt; }
  .subtitle { color: #64748b; font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 18pt; line-height: 1.5; }
  .footer { position: absolute; left: 0.75in; right: 0.75in; bottom: 0.45in; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 9pt; color: #94a3b8; }
  .footer .wordmark { font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; }

  /* Cover */
  .page-cover { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .cover-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 0.4in; }
  .cover-top .logo { max-width: 120px; max-height: 70px; object-fit: contain; }
  .cover-top .lumidian-wordmark { font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 2pt; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; }
  .cover-hero { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; max-width: 6in; }
  .cover-hero .eyebrow { font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 2.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 12pt; }
  .cover-hero .name { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: 36pt; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 6pt; line-height: 1.1; word-break: break-word; font-weight: 600; }
  .cover-hero .date { font-size: 12pt; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 36pt; }
  .cover-hero .hook { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 26pt; line-height: 1.25; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 14pt; font-weight: 500; }
  .cover-hero .sub { font-size: 13pt; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 28pt; }
  .cover-hero .pill-row { display: flex; gap: 8pt; align-items: center; }
  .cover-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 14pt; border-top: 1px solid #ececec; font-size: 9.5pt; color: #94a3b8; }

  /* Pill (used in cover + scorecard) */
  .pill { display: inline-block; padding: 3pt 12pt; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .pill-loss { background: #fef2f2; color: #b91c1c; }
  .pill-untapped { background: #fffbeb; color: #b45309; }
  .pill-tied { background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; }
  .pill-lead { background: #f0fdf4; color: #16a34a; }
  .pill-uncontested { background: #ecfdf5; color: #059669; }

  /* Executive summary */
  .lede-block { background: #fff; border-left: 3pt solid #5f7ea6; padding: 14pt 18pt; margin: 0 0 22pt; font-size: 13pt; line-height: 1.55; color: #0f172a; }
  .lede-block strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .score-row { display: flex; gap: 11pt; margin: 0 0 20pt; }
  .score-card { flex: 1; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ececec; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14pt 12pt 12pt; text-align: center; }
  .score-card .label { font-size: 8.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 8pt; font-weight: 600; }
  .score-card .value { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 34pt; line-height: 1; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; }
  .score-card .caption { font-size: 9pt; color: #64748b; margin-top: 7pt; line-height: 1.4; }
  .methodology { font-size: 8.5pt; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 22pt; padding-top: 12pt; border-top: 1px solid #ececec; }

  /* Per-prompt scorecard */
  .prompt-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ececec; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12pt 14pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .prompt-card.kind-loss { border-left: 3pt solid #b91c1c; }
  .prompt-card.kind-untapped { border-left: 3pt solid #b45309; }
  .prompt-card.kind-tied { border-left: 3pt solid #94a3b8; }
  .prompt-card.kind-lead { border-left: 3pt solid #16a34a; }
  .prompt-card.kind-uncontested { border-left: 3pt solid #059669; }
  .prompt-card .top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; }
  .prompt-card .q { font-style: italic; color: #0f172a; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.4; flex: 1; }
  .prompt-card .badge-stack { text-align: right; }
  .bar-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10pt; margin: 3pt 0; font-size: 9.5pt; }
  .bar-row .bar-label { width: 58pt; color: #64748b; }
  .bar-row .bar { flex: 1; height: 8pt; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
  .bar-row .bar > span { display: block; height: 100%; }
  .bar-row .pct { width: 36pt; text-align: right; color: #334155; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 500; }
  .bar-own > span  { background: #5f7ea6; }
  .bar-peer > span { background: #cbd5e1; }

  /* Action / "Where you can win" blocks */
  .action-block { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ececec; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16pt 18pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; page-break-inside: avoid; }
  .action-block.kind-loss { border-left: 4pt solid #b91c1c; }
  .action-block.kind-untapped { border-left: 4pt solid #b45309; }
  .action-block.kind-uncontested { border-left: 4pt solid #059669; }
  .action-block.kind-tied { border-left: 4pt solid #94a3b8; }
  .action-block.kind-lead { border-left: 4pt solid #16a34a; }
  .action-block .q { font-style: italic; color: #475569; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; }
  .action-block .punch { font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8pt; }
  .action-block .punch strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .action-block .why { font-size: 10pt; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.55; }

  /* Recommendations */
  .recs { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ececec; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16pt 20pt; }
  .recs ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 22pt; }
  .recs ol li { font-size: 10.5pt; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12pt; }
  .recs ol li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .recs strong { color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700; }
  .recs p { margin: 4pt 0; }
  .static-fallback { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ececec; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16pt 20pt; }
  .static-fallback ul { margin: 6pt 0; padding-left: 22pt; }
  .static-fallback li { margin-bottom: 6pt; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.55; color: #334155; }

  /* CTA page */
  .page-cta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .cta-content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; max-width: 6in; }
  .cta-content .eyebrow { font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: 2.5pt; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 14pt; }
  .cta-content .hook { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 30pt; line-height: 1.2; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 18pt; font-weight: 500; }
  .cta-content .body { font-size: 12pt; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 22pt; max-width: 5.5in; }
  .offer-block { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ececec; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16pt 20pt; margin-bottom: 22pt; }
  .offer-block .offer-title { font-size: 10pt; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; }
  .offer-block ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18pt; }
  .offer-block li { font-size: 10.5pt; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6pt; }
  .offer-block li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .offer-block li strong { color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700; }
  .cta-contacts { font-size: 11pt; color: #5f7ea6; }
  .cta-contacts a { color: #5f7ea6; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
  .cta-contacts .item { margin-bottom: 6pt; }
  .cta-footer { font-size: 9.5pt; color: #94a3b8; padding-top: 14pt; border-top: 1px solid #ececec; margin-top: auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
  .cta-footer .who { font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ───────────────────────────────────── COVER ───────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page page-cover">
  <div class="cover-top">
    {% if logo_data_uri %}
      <img src="{{ logo_data_uri }}" class="logo" alt="{{ business_name }}" />
    {% else %}
      <div style="font-size:14pt;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;">{{ business_name }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="lumidian-wordmark">Lumidian</div>
  </div>

  <div class="cover-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">AI Visibility Audit</div>
    <div class="name">{{ business_name }}</div>
    <div class="date">{{ audit_month }}{% if location %} · {{ location }}{% endif %}</div>

    <div class="hook">{{ cover_hook }}</div>
    <div class="sub">{{ cover_sub }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="cover-meta">
    <div>Prepared by Lumidian</div>
    <div>{{ generated_label }}</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ─────────────────────────────── EXECUTIVE SUMMARY ─────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page">
  <h4>Executive Summary</h4>
  <h2>Where {{ business_name }} stands on AI search</h2>
  <div class="subtitle">90 queries to ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini — questions a real customer would ask.</div>

  <div class="lede-block">{{ summary_lead }}</div>

  <div class="score-row">
    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="label">Your Visibility</div>
      <div class="value">{{ overall_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</div>
      <div class="caption">of relevant AI responses mention you</div>
    </div>
    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="label">Peer Average</div>
      <div class="value">{{ peer_avg_overall|round|int }}%</div>
      <div class="caption">competitors averaged this across the same prompts</div>
    </div>
    <div class="score-card">
      <div class="label">Searches Missing You</div>
      <div class="value">{{ missing_pct|round|int }}%</div>
      <div class="caption">of potential customers don't hear your name</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>Your peer group: {{ peer_names_joined }}.</p>

  <p class="methodology">
    <strong>Methodology:</strong> 10 generated prompts × 3 models (ChatGPT search, Perplexity Sonar-Pro, Gemini 2.5 Flash) × 3 runs = 90 queries total. Visibility = the share of those queries where {{ business_name }} appeared in the response. Generated {{ generated_label }}.
  </p>
</div>

<!-- ────────────────────────── PER-PROMPT SCORECARD ────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page page-break">
  <h2>Per-prompt breakdown</h2>
  <div class="subtitle">All 10 prompts, sorted by what needs your attention first.</div>

  {% for ps in scorecard %}
  <div class="prompt-card kind-{{ ps.kind }}">
    <div class="top">
      <div class="q">"{{ ps.prompt_text }}"</div>
      <div class="badge-stack">
        <span class="pill pill-{{ ps.kind }}">
          {% if ps.kind == 'loss' %}LOSING
          {% elif ps.kind == 'untapped' %}UNTAPPED
          {% elif ps.kind == 'tied' %}TIED
          {% elif ps.kind == 'lead' %}AHEAD
          {% else %}UNCONTESTED{% endif %}
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bar-row bar-own">
      <div class="bar-label">You</div>
      <div class="bar"><span style="width: {{ ps.own_visibility_pct }}%"></span></div>
      <div class="pct">{{ ps.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</div>
    </div>
    <div class="bar-row bar-peer">
      <div class="bar-label">Peers avg</div>
      <div class="bar"><span style="width: {{ ps.peer_avg_visibility_pct }}%"></span></div>
      <div class="pct">{{ ps.peer_avg_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<!-- ────────────────────────── WHERE TO ACT ────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page page-break">
  <h2>Where to focus first</h2>
  <div class="subtitle">The three prompts where the move matters most.</div>

  {% for w in action_blocks %}
  <div class="action-block kind-{{ w.kind }}">
    <div class="q">"{{ w.prompt_text }}"</div>
    <div class="punch">
      {% if w.kind == 'loss' and w.top_competitor_name %}
        <strong>{{ w.top_competitor_name }}</strong> dominates this question with <strong>{{ w.top_competitor_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong> visibility — you're at <strong>{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong>.
      {% elif w.kind == 'loss' %}
        Competitors collectively appear in <strong>{{ w.peer_avg_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong> of responses — you're at <strong>{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong>.
      {% elif w.kind == 'untapped' %}
        No competitor and no one in your industry surfaces here yet — this is an open category in AI search. Whoever publishes first owns it.
      {% elif w.kind == 'uncontested' %}
        Only you appear in responses to this — peers are at <strong>0%</strong>. A fragile lead worth defending with more content.
      {% elif w.kind == 'tied' %}
        You and competitors are tied at <strong>{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong>. A small content push pulls you clear.
      {% else %}
        You're ahead at <strong>{{ w.own_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong> vs peers at <strong>{{ w.peer_avg_visibility_pct|round|int }}%</strong>. Defend and widen.
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="why">
      {% if w.kind == 'loss' %}
        AI models are pulling from competitor content. The fastest way to close the gap is publishing on the same surfaces they're being cited from (LinkedIn, Medium, Reddit, Quora).
      {% elif w.kind == 'untapped' %}
        AI models have no authoritative source to pull from in your local market. A single well-structured long-form piece can become THE citation across all three models.
      {% elif w.kind == 'uncontested' %}
        The position is real but fragile — any competitor publishing one strong piece could flip the citation.
      {% else %}
        Maintain the lead with regular updates and structured schema so AI models keep citing you.
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<!-- ────────────────────────── RECOMMENDATIONS ────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page page-break">
  <h2>What we'd do about it</h2>
  <div class="subtitle">3–5 recommendations, ranked by impact.</div>

  {% if recommendations_html %}
    <div class="recs">{{ recommendations_html|safe }}</div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="static-fallback">
      <p>Lumidian closes AI visibility gaps with a recurring monthly playbook:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>12+ AI-optimized long-form articles every month</strong> — distributed across LinkedIn, Medium, Reddit, Quora, and X, structured for how ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini actually extract content.</li>
        <li><strong>YouTube video AI-readability optimization</strong> — we take your existing videos, transcribe them, restructure descriptions and chapters, and re-publish so AI models can pull facts directly from them.</li>
        <li><strong>Website audit for highest-impact AI-readability wins</strong> — schema, structure, citation surfaces, FAQ markup; the technical layer that determines whether AI models cite your pages.</li>
        <li><strong>Weekly visibility tracking</strong> across ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, and Gemini — so you know which prompts moved and why.</li>
        <li><strong>Competitor monitoring</strong> — flagged within days when a peer publishes AI-citable content in your category.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>

<!-- ────────────────────────── CTA ────────────────────────── -->
<div class="page page-cta page-break">
  <div class="cover-top">
    <div></div>
    <div class="lumidian-wordmark">Lumidian</div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-content">
    <div class="eyebrow">Next step</div>
    <div class="hook">Ready to close the {{ missing_pct|round|int }}% gap?</div>
    <div class="body">
      Lumidian builds AI visibility for {{ business_name }} and businesses like it. We turn audits like this one into measurable visibility lift across ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini within 60 days.
    </div>

    <div class="offer-block">
      <div class="offer-title">How Lumidian works</div>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>You see every move in your dashboard, not in monthly emails.</strong> When an article we publish moves a query, it shows up the same week. When a competitor publishes, you see it within days.</li>
        <li><strong>Content isn't templates — it's engineered from your audit.</strong> Each piece is briefed from your visibility data: which prompts you're losing, which competitors lead, which sources AI models actually cite.</li>
        <li><strong>Clusters, not one-offs.</strong> A single topic becomes a coordinated set across LinkedIn, Medium, Reddit, Quora, and X — same brief, different surface — so AI models see consistent citations in multiple places.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="offer-block">
      <div class="offer-title">What you'd get</div>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>12+ AI-optimized articles a month</strong> on LinkedIn, Medium, Reddit, Quora, X — coordinated as content clusters around your highest-priority queries.</li>
        <li><strong>YouTube video optimization</strong> — we restructure your existing videos (transcripts, descriptions, chapters) so AI models can pull from them.</li>
        <li><strong>Website AI-readability audit</strong> — highest-impact technical wins (schema, structure, citation surfaces).</li>
        <li><strong>Live tracking dashboard</strong> across ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, and Gemini — with cluster-level attribution and competitor alerts.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="cta-contacts">
      <div class="item">Reply to this email — or:</div>
      {% if cta_url %}<div class="item"><a href="{{ cta_url }}">{{ cta_url }}</a></div>{% endif %}
      {% if cta_email %}<div class="item"><a href="mailto:{{ cta_email }}">{{ cta_email }}</a></div>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-footer">
    <div><span class="who">Lumidian</span> · AI visibility audits and content</div>
    <div>{{ generated_label }}</div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
